WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.486
This is a short demonstration of tab recorder.

2
00:00:07.486 --> 00:00:10.032
Record a browser tab while the video plays.

3
00:00:10.032 --> 00:00:13.600
Speech becomes a time stamped transcript in the side panel.

4
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.179
When the recording finishes,

5
00:00:15.179 --> 00:00:19.273
save the video and export the captions as a WebVTT file.

6
00:00:19.273 --> 00:00:20.093
Keep the meeting.

7
00:00:20.093 --> 00:00:22.705
And keep the words.

